                  Always Get FREE Shipping
                </li>
                <li>
                  <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2340/1623/files/check-icon.svg?v=1738836704" alt="Check icon" class="list-icon">
                  Skip or Gift Upcoming Orders
                </li>
                <li>
                  <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2340/1623/files/check-icon.svg?v=1738836704" alt="Check icon" class="list-icon">
